Package: mica-docker
Version: 29.9.1-1
Source-Date-Epoch: 1792383840
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Mica OS <hi@micaos.dev>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Provides: mica-container-engine
Conflicts: mica-podman
Depends: mica-system, nftables, libc6 (>= 2.38), libseccomp2 (>= 2.6.0)
Description: Mica OS Docker engine
 Docker 29.9.1 (dockerd and the docker CLI), docker compose 5.6.0, containerd
 2.4.2, runc 1.5.2 and tini 0.19.0 as docker-init, built from pinned upstream
 source, with /etc/docker/daemon.json: data under /mica/containers/docker,
 the local log driver and the nftables firewall backend. The podman engine of
 mica-podman conflicts.
 .
 Nothing is enabled: micad enables docker.service from the container.enabled
 setting. dockerd execs nft for its firewall rules, so nftables is declared.
 mica-system provides the /mica/containers mount the configuration uses.
